        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are lost in a dark forest, and the night is coming on with no way out.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With only your flashlight in hand, can you survive until dawn?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FOREST SURVIVAL&quot; is a thrilling 2D survival action game in which you use jump, dash, and flashlight to cut through the darkness.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim for the dawn while hiding from the approaching “something” and sometimes fighting it off with the light of your flashlight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The controls are simple, but the strategic use of the flashlight's angle and intensity creates a sense of tension.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The behavior of enemies who sneak up on you when you are not “looking” and the game's development that changes over time will always provide new thrills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 2D side-scrolling survival action  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Players play games with enemies who sneak up on them by exploiting their blind spots  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Strategic light manipulation to switch the beam angle and intensity of the flashlight  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Normal mode&quot; to clear the game after surviving for a certain period of time  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Endless Mode&quot; to aim for a high score</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Translated with  (free version)</p>",
